# NuGet packages
**/packages/*
*.nupkg

# Published output
[Bb]in/Release/
[Bb]in/Debug/
publish/

# Environment / Secret files (Optional: Uncomment if you store local secrets in json files)
# appsettings.Development.json
# appsettings.Local.json